1. Design End-to-End Data Solutions for AML Use Cases
You design the complete flow from source systems to AML reports, alerts, and analytics.
2. Define Architecture Standards and Best Practices
Ingestion Standard - All source systems land data in Bronze.
Data Quality Standard - Mandatory validation before Silver.
Delta Standard - All tables stored in Delta format.
Naming Standard – 
bronze_customer
silver_customer
gold_customer_risk
Security Standard - PII columns masked for non-authorized users.


